is heet / koud.</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Ostern</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Pasen</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Es ist windig.</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Het waait.</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Silvester</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">oudejaarsavond</td></tr></table>"
